        <mxCell id="K_BGmsbE8tWditb4g_c6-132" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Evaluation&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;Instead of having a closed-form conversation (where we would have to predefine the follow-up questions) we create a candidate profile and ask an LLM how to answer based on the score we want to achieve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
